  "body": "Take a look at 28A Awarua Crescent, Orakei.\r\n\r\n\r\n• A builder’s own home. Solid, substantial, and 349m² of it.\r\n\r\n• Water views across Orakei Basin towards the city. Four bedrooms. Four bathrooms. Your own internal lift.\r\n\r\n• Room for three cars in the garage, including a vehicle stacker.\r\n\r\n• A CV of $3.55 million, and we’re talking well below that.\r\n\r\n• Put it against the competition. Then come and tell me where you’re finding better buying in Auckland.",
